      "units": [
        {
          "id": "route53-01",
          "slide": 1,
          "text": "Amazon Route 53 answers D N S questions. It tells a browser where to connect. Let's follow a request for app dot example dot com. The browser first asks its recursive D N S resolver.",
          "text_sha256": "918f1ea7842407c0edde47f4844103e449fcc7b57ef9538bca798d46e2b5e878",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "324447a7a91822a7b2c88b46f0492de1c0c0c7d95b43386b9bc7f1eb6928047a",
          "asset_sha256": "ad075036c5c2459e7be9b4ad7ec5cd912b58e38b856b3c5b4e7977d52442c583"
        },
        {
          "id": "route53-02",
          "slide": 2,
          "text": "If the resolver has no cached answer, it follows the public D N S delegation to Route 53. Route 53 is authoritative for this hosted zone. An A alias record for app dot example dot com points to the Application Load Balancer.",
          "text_sha256": "a9abb0858b2315a09d4470199763c662f790f76df0506e8cda7b9965561b3d83",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "96a920b5fb05825bc9e611f80e495d2085b2a1db7774c8d2f40c1cd5b1be86a0",
          "asset_sha256": "ad075036c5c2459e7be9b4ad7ec5cd912b58e38b856b3c5b4e7977d52442c583"
        },
        {
          "id": "route53-03",
          "slide": 3,
          "text": "Route 53 returns the load balancer's I P addresses. The resolver caches that answer for its time to live, and sends it back to the browser. A later lookup can use the cached answer while it is still valid.",
          "text_sha256": "9072da4842b010134156dfca3c55288ce1c277bedebe07710e1658366b9436e8",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "a8300fed5fad3f06ebc7ab1e54c199848e913940d69d306c2b021151108f9457",
          "asset_sha256": "ad075036c5c2459e7be9b4ad7ec5cd912b58e38b856b3c5b4e7977d52442c583"
        },
        {
          "id": "route53-04",
          "slide": 4,
          "text": "Now the browser uses an address to connect directly to the load balancer over H T T P S. The load balancer forwards the request to a healthy Amazon E C two target. Route 53 answers D N S queries. It never proxies the web request.",
          "text_sha256": "673f95ad42fae8a01dd0095a0ab6ff5ed033d0980a097b126817ef9f5f97aca0",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "6a209865a89df00cd7b7e368455a91304398f7b92edcab37ce5a24a7fad76be7",
          "asset_sha256": "ad075036c5c2459e7be9b4ad7ec5cd912b58e38b856b3c5b4e7977d52442c583"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
